     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19px\">I&#39;m really newbie to ggvis and I searched all over web without success.<br>I have a dataset like this one: <br></p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\">data.example=data.frame(&quot;V1&quot;=c(rep(&quot;A&quot;,times=10),rep(&quot;B&quot;,times=10)),&quot;V2&quot;=c(runif(10,1,10000),runif(10,100,1000)))\r\n\r\nhead(data.example)\r\n     V1       V2\r\n    1  A 7261.076\r\n    2  A 1955.755\r\n    3  A 3473.473\r\n    4  A 7593.278\r\n    5  A 3218.867\r\n    6  A 4997.951\r\n\r\ntail(data.example)\r\nV1       V2\r\n15  B 721.2147\r\n16  B 185.6676\r\n17  B 939.3541\r\n18  B 276.0682\r\n19  B 910.0322\r\n20  B 444.2188\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19px\">I can do boxplot with linear scale in y</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\">data.example %&gt;%\r\n  ggvis(x=~V1,y=~V2,fill=~V1) %&gt;%\r\n  layer_boxplots() %&gt;%\r\n  scale_numeric(&quot;y&quot;,trans=&quot;linear&quot;)\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7iTJt37Wx5Q/VQLXlMGstfI/AAAAAAAAA5I/TlY1RA4h9lc/s1600/plot_416803022.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7iTJt37Wx5Q/VQLXlMGstfI/AAAAAAAAA5I/TlY1RA4h9lc/s1600/plot_416803022.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484760145000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0b5xsAAz-lT7gO23ywwMY8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7iTJt37Wx5Q/VQLXlMGstfI/AAAAAAAAA5I/TlY1RA4h9lc/s320/plot_416803022.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"236\"></a></p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><br></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19px\">and a box plot with log scale in y</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\">data.example %&gt;%\r\n  ggvis(x=~V1,y=~V2,fill=~V1) %&gt;%\r\n  layer_boxplots() %&gt;%\r\n  scale_numeric(&quot;y&quot;,trans=&quot;log&quot;)\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-mAeW67ke7EU/VQLXp5s67rI/AAAAAAAAA5Q/uWSzl4ctQFU/s1600/plot_668911947.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-mAeW67ke7EU/VQLXp5s67rI/AAAAAAAAA5Q/uWSzl4ctQFU/s1600/plot_668911947.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484760145000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Jq16RNE2DwqLVr_Q5vE05\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-mAeW67ke7EU/VQLXp5s67rI/AAAAAAAAA5Q/uWSzl4ctQFU/s320/plot_668911947.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"236\"></a></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19px\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19px\">I can&#39;t be able to do a dynamic box plot with coordinate transformation selection with code like this:</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\">select.trans=input_select(choices = c(&quot;Linear&quot;=&quot;linear&quot;,&quot;Logarithmic&quot;=&quot;log&quot;),selected=&quot;linear&quot;,label=&quot;Scale&quot;)\r\ndata.example %&gt;%\r\n  ggvis(x=~V1,y=~V2,fill=~V1) %&gt;%\r\n  layer_boxplots() %&gt;%\r\n  scale_numeric(&quot;y&quot;,trans=select.trans,expand=0)\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19px\">with this error message:</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\">Error in match(x, table, nomatch = 0L) : \r\n  &#39;match&#39; requires vectorial arguments\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19px\">May be I ignored some essential ggvis things? <br>Thanks</p></div>"
